NAME
    ln - create a symbolic or hard link

SYNOPSIS
    ln TARGET LINK_NAME
    ln -s TARGET LINK_NAME

DESCRIPTION
    Without -s, creates a same-filesystem hard link to an existing regular
    file. With -s, stores TARGET as a symbolic link. Relative symbolic targets
    are resolved from LINK_NAME's parent directory. FAT32 and providers without
    link support reject both forms.
